Files with no upstream counterpart (new work for NotchCenter):

  Plugins/LidAngleKit/Sources/LidAngleMonitor.swift
      Lid state machine (open / closing / closed) and polling, lifted out of
      Mac-Duo's LidController so other plugins can reuse it.
  Plugins/LidAngleDepthPlugin/Sources/LidAngleDepthPlugin.swift
  Plugins/LidAngleDepthPlugin/Sources/LidConsoleBlockView.swift
  Plugins/LidAngleDepthPlugin/Sources/LidDepthSettingsView.swift
  Plugins/LidAngleDepthPlugin/Sources/LidDepthPreferences.swift
  Plugins/LidAngleDepthPlugin/Sources/DepthProjection.swift
  Plugins/LidAngleDepthPlugin/Sources/NSScreen+Display.swift
  Plugins/LidAngleDepthPlugin/Sources/LidDepthLog.swift
  Plugins/LidAngleDepthPlugin/Sources/L10n.swift

Differences from upstream are marked "与上游的差异" in the file headers. The
substantive ones: the overlay window level avoids the private shielding level so
the host's own panels stay reachable; settings persist through the host's
StateStore instead of UserDefaults; capture falls back to a single frame when
Screen Recording permission is missing.
